## Getting started

```sh
# See everything at once: roadmap, decisions, CI, pipelines, freshness
fid dash

# Verify the product is in order
fid doctor

# Add capabilities (edit to match what you need)
fid add app next        # Next.js web app
fid add app tauri       # Tauri desktop/mobile app
fid add firmware rp2040 # RP2040 firmware

# Run pipelines
fid derive

# Check for drift (run in CI)
fid derive --check
```

